NAME
    who - list every session and which account it's running as

SYNOPSIS
    who

DESCRIPTION
    A different axis from 'ps': 'ps' lists killable THINGS (breakpoints/
    watches/sessions); this lists WHO is running each session, if a session
    manager is registered for this host (see 'tmux'). With none registered,
    just reports this one shell's own account instead of failing.

EXAMPLES
    who
